{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02627","headline":"北山 · 王绩","name":"北山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧知山里绝氛埃，登高日暮心悠哉。\n子平一去何时返？仲叔长游遂不来。\n幽兰独夜清琴曲，桂树凌云浊酒杯。\n槁项同枯木，丹心等死灰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02627.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02627","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}